---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="belove · privacy" description="Privacy policy for being.love, the website of belove and BeingWell Technologies.">
    <main class="page">
        <a class="wordmark" href="/"><span class="be">be</span><span class="love">love</span></a>
        <h1>privacy</h1>
        <div class="prose">
            <p class="muted">Effective July 12, 2026</p>
            <p>This privacy policy describes how BeingWell Technologies, PBC ("BeingWell," "we," or "us") collects, uses, and shares information in connection with the being.love website. This policy applies to this website only. Products and services we offer in the future may be covered by their own privacy policies.</p>

            <h2>information we collect</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Information you provide.</strong> If you join our waitlist or contact us, we collect the information you choose to give us, such as your email address and the contents of your message.</li>
                <li><strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> Like most websites, we and our service providers may automatically collect technical information about your visit, such as IP address, browser type, pages viewed, and referring pages. We may use cookies and similar technologies.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>how we use information</h2>
            <p>We may use the information we collect to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>operate, maintain, and improve the website and our services;</li>
                <li>communicate with you, including sending updates about <span class="bl">belove</span> and responding to your inquiries;</li>
                <li>monitor and analyze usage of the website;</li>
                <li>protect the security and integrity of our services;</li>
                <li>comply with legal obligations; and</li>
                <li>carry out any other purpose described to you at the time of collection, or with your consent.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>how we share information</h2>
            <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share information:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>with service providers that perform services on our behalf, such as hosting, analytics, data storage, and email delivery;</li>
                <li>to comply with applicable law, regulation, or legal process, or to protect the rights, property, or safety of BeingWell, our users, or others;</li>
                <li>in connection with a corporate transaction, such as a merger, acquisition, financing, or sale of assets; and</li>
                <li>with your consent or at your direction.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>data retention</h2>
            <p>We keep personal information for as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes described in this policy, unless a longer retention period is required or permitted by law.</p>

            <h2>security</h2>
            <p>We take reasonable measures to protect the information we hold. However, no method of transmission or storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

            <h2>your choices</h2>
            <p>You can opt out of waitlist emails at any time by following the unsubscribe instructions in those emails or by contacting us at <a href="mailto:hello@being.love">hello@being.love</a>. You may also contact us to request access to or deletion of your information, and we will respond as required by applicable law.</p>

            <h2>children</h2>
            <p>This website is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from them.</p>

            <h2>visitors from outside the united states</h2>
            <p>We operate from the United States, and the information we collect is processed and stored in the United States, where privacy laws may differ from those in your jurisdiction.</p>

            <h2>changes to this policy</h2>
            <p>We may update this policy from time to time. We will post the updated version on this page with a new effective date.</p>

            <h2>contact</h2>
            <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@being.love">hello@being.love</a>.</p>
        </div>
    </main>
</Base>
